Wearemighty is leaving game development behind and rebranding as SecretSauce Labs, shifting its focus entirely to AI content technology after three years spent developing tools to solve a production problem that began inside games.&nbsp;

The company, previously known as Mighty Bear Games before becoming wearemighty in January 2026, developed games including Disney Melee Mania, Mighty Action Heroes and Butter Royale. It now focuses on helping brands produce content at scale while maintaining consistency across advertising, social media, and product content. ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/secretsauce-labs-simon-davis-on-leaving-games-behind-and-solving-ais-brand-consistency-problem/">MORE</a>]
